<title>USA: Weatherford's Burguieres resigns as CEO.</title>
<headline>Weatherford's Burguieres resigns as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weatherford Enterra Inc said on Thursday that Philip Burguieres has resigned as president and chief executive, but will continue to serve as company chairman.</p>
<p>Thomas Amonett, who has been acting chief executive since Burguieres took a leave of absence July 29, will continue as acting chief until a replacement is found, the company said.</p>
<p>The company did not immediately provide a reason for Burguieres's resignation.</p>
</text>
